messages[12]{user,text}:
  user_2,Hello Rohan, this is Sunita from Protect All Agency, can you hear me okay? [00:00]
  user_1,Yeah, I can hear you, hi Sunita. [00:03]
  user_2,Great. I just wanted to confirm you received the final policy PDF I sent yesterday? [00:07]
  user_1,Yes, I opened it, looks good. I’ll sign it tonight and email it back. [00:12]
  user_2,Perfect. Once we get the signed copy, we’ll move the status from Pending to Active. [00:15]
  user_1,Uh, do I need to do anything else? Like another document or something? [00:18]
  user_2,No, the deed, utility bill and fire‑safety certificate are already on file, so just the signed policy. [00:22]
  user_1,Okay, and the premium payment? Can I pay online? [00:26]
  user_2,Yes, you’ll get a payment link in the email with the signed copy, you can pay via net banking or credit card. [00:30]
  user_1,Alright, thanks. I’ll send it by tonight, maybe around 9 pm. [00:34]
  user_2,Sounds good, Rohan. Once we receive it, we’ll activate the policy by tomorrow morning. Any other questions? [00:38]
  user_1,No, that’s all. Thanks for your help. [00:41]